  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Ingest",
      "items": [
        "Loaders turn md, txt, html, docx and pdf into text pages; the title is the first heading or the file name",
        "Each chunk embeds its title and heading path with its text, and is keyed by sha256 of that, normalized",
        "Only hashes not already stored for the file are embedded; unchanged chunks are kept, missing ones deleted, all in one transaction",
        "--prune deletes chunks of files that no longer exist under the path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Search",
      "items": [
        "Vector search orders by cosine distance on the HNSW index; full text ORs the query's terms and ranks with ts_rank_cd",
        "RRF merges both lists (k = 60) without comparing their scores",
        "The reranker scores at most 8 pairs (latency grows quickly past about 10); then the top 6 that fit 2,500 estimated tokens are kept, and always the first"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "When something fails",
      "items": [
        "Embeddings down or their breaker open: the search runs on full text only, and the result tells the model so",
        "Reranker error: the fused order is used",
        "Any other error: ToolRetryMiddleware retries the search once, then gives the model a message to relay",
        "RERANKER_MODEL empty (CI) turns reranking off"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Reranker on the API pods",
      "items": [
        "The reranker-model Job downloads the model once into a volume the API pods mount read-only",
        "It loads on first use, and one rerank runs at a time per pod, since each ONNX run already uses every core",
        "It's why the API pods ask for 2 GiB: about 1.7 GB with the model loaded, under load"
      ]
    }
  ]
